{"slug":"community-call-nov-2026","date":"2026-11-27","kicker":"Artz Friday","clearBars":true,"title":"November's Community Call: Artz Friday","description":"A walk through the Lounge with the artists and art thanked on Artz Friday's November community call with Tezos Commons.","artist":{"name":"November's Community Call","x":"@TezosCommons","bluesky":"","website":"https://radio.tezoscommons.org"},"space":{"date":"2026-11-27","recording":"https://radio.tezoscommons.org"},"intro":"This Lounge is an experimental build in beta and may change frequently.","works":[{"title":"⠠⠁⠀⠠⠌⠕⠗⠽⠀⠷⠀⠠⠇⠊⠋⠑ A Story of Life","kind":"image","media":"media/community-call-nov-2026/a-story-of-life.webp","w":2375,"h":1683,"by":"maryam","platform":"objkt","link":"https://objkt.com/tokens/KT1U8jrNp8vTZmpkC5SnwZdEVuxqLQVWZBAd/50","about":"Khaneh-ye Firouzmandi came to life once again, not merely through the frame of a photograph, but through the touch of the hands of those who cannot see with their eyes, yet saw with their fingertips.","bay":300},{"title":"⠠⠎⠳⠇⠀⠈⠯⠀⠠⠓⠑⠜⠞⠀⠠⠤⠀⠞⠺⠕⠀⠇⠇⠀⠎⠳⠇⠎⠂⠀⠐⠕⠀⠃⠂⠥⠞⠊⠰⠇⠀⠇⠕⠧⠑⠲ Soul & Heart — two little souls,one beautiful love.","kind":"image","media":"media/community-call-nov-2026/soul-and-heart.webp","w":4580,"h":2357,"by":"maryam","platform":"Teia","link":"https://teia.art/objkt/885861","about":"When two hearts are close, even the stoniest place in the world feels filled with love and peace.","bay":240},{"title":"Tree of Life","kind":"image","media":"media/community-call-nov-2026/tree-of-life.webp","w":2268,"h":4032,"by":"Sandytoes","platform":"Teia","link":"https://teia.art/objkt/885194","about":"This is the living body of a giant sequoia, descended from an ancient lineage and capable of living for thousands of years. The heavens kept their stars. Earth answered with a tree.","bay":330},{"title":"Sequoia Family Tree","kind":"image","media":"media/community-call-nov-2026/sequoia-family-tree.webp","w":4284,"h":5712,"by":"Sandytoes","platform":"Teia","link":"https://teia.art/objkt/885430","about":"Through a fisheye, the familiar world bends and our perspective shifts. Perhaps ours needs to. A tree should still inspire wonder, mystery and gratitude.","bay":210},{"title":"Granite 32","kind":"image","media":"media/community-call-nov-2026/granite-32.webp","w":1800,"h":1800,"by":"Fendel","platform":"objkt","link":"https://objkt.com/tokens/KT1CBDCBPDGD3VvXWZqBcAMw73gGn2GnQEmX/57","about":"Minted for Neighvember 2026. Digital collage combining photography and imagery from Trove.pictures, the app by Flex.","bay":0},{"title":"Door To Monastic Cell","kind":"image","media":"media/community-call-nov-2026/door-to-monastic-cell.webp","w":1197,"h":1682,"by":"Fendel","platform":"objkt","link":"https://objkt.com/tokens/KT1CBDCBPDGD3VvXWZqBcAMw73gGn2GnQEmX/56","about":"A small green door opens into one of the monastic cells of Deir es-Sultan, the centuries-old Ethiopian monastery situated on the rooftop of the Church of the Holy Sepulchre in Jerusalem's Old City.","bay":180},{"title":"Prometheus","kind":"video","media":"media/community-call-nov-2026/prometheus.mp4","poster":"media/community-call-nov-2026/prometheus.webp","w":1448,"h":1086,"by":"CobwebSaints","platform":"Teia","link":"https://teia.art/objkt/887202","about":"Elements pulled from the earth. Iron forged and shaped. Oil refined. A machine designed, built, broken apart, and put back together. Then imbued with a magic spark. Behold, I bring you fire. Created for the #PostAmericana Circus Maximus Event, December 2026 on TEIA.","bay":30},{"title":"Prancerland and Prancers Do America","kind":"video","media":"media/community-call-nov-2026/yoeshi-pair.mp4","poster":"media/community-call-nov-2026/yoeshi-pair.webp","w":1280,"h":1560,"by":"Yoeshi","platform":"Teia","link":"https://teia.art/tz/tz1ae2d1BJt7YUqaaec6Xenh3mBqS7VjSZtK","about":"My spin on Lewis Carroll's Cheshire Cat for TeiaTeatime26. Tap the cat, tap the cup. Prancers Do America opens in a Prancer Pads living room with the race on t